# Acceptance
File id only: `playbook-step-07-acceptance.mdc`.

## Feature column Приёмка
- Enter Приёмка only after merge and green Deploy to dev. Run the manual and e2e cases (bug-feature: those cases) plus a short smoke. One issue comment listing cases passed or failed by id.
- Tiny miss (typo, or a 500 caused by a typo): fix it in this feature. No new issue. Stay in Приёмка until the redeploy passes.
- Substantial miss (add or remove a field, change a screen, change a business rule): open a bug-feature linked to this feature. This issue stays in Приёмка. Do not close it.
- Pass, and the Doc- page named in the PR is written when one was named (`playbook-step-08-docs.mdc`): set `статус: готово` and close the issue in the same moment (`board-sync` moves the card to Готово). Do not move the Projects card by hand. A follow-up comment may note the merged PR. Do not add `closes`/`fix`/`fixes` and do not call `addCloseIssueReferences`. After close, `.github/workflows/link-closed-by.yml` sets the PR chip. Carve-out for a hand move or a manual Development link: the owner explicitly asks.
- The owner may spot-check major features. The lead still owns the acceptance comment and the close.

## Epic column На ревью (owner acceptance)
- When every child is Готово (closed), do not close the epic yet. Set `статус: на ревью`. Summarize what shipped (features, Doc- and wiki links, how to check on dev) and ask the owner to accept the epic.
- The checklist is the problem, the chosen user story, and the non-goals in «Бизнес-анализ». Closed children are not enough.
- Owner pass: set `статус: готово`, close the epic, mark the wiki `Epic-` page «сделано» (content mark, not a second status).
- Owner finds gaps: set the epic back to `статус: в работе`. Related gaps become features or bug-features under this epic. Unrelated discoveries go to the standing bugs epic and do not stop this epic. Do not mark the epic Готово until a later owner pass.
- After epic acceptance: epic pick (`playbook-workflow.mdc` «Epic pick and queue»). Do not start the next roadmap epic until this one is Готово, unless the owner has already confirmed a parallel set.

## CI/CD wake
- After merge, set `Waiting on` = Deploy in the lead pipeline note (`/home/box/shared/travelagency/work/pipeline.md`). Do not create a per-task wait-watch routine.
- When «TravelAgency CI/CD» wakes on successful Deploy to dev for a sha that includes the merge, set Приёмка if the label is still Разработка, then run acceptance.
- When this issue's remaining criteria live on a sibling issue, keep both open until joint acceptance; close them together (`playbook-workflow.mdc`).
